      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[The first release of Stash for Mac.

- Browse posts you save from X in a masonry gallery or justified rows
- Hover a video to preview it; open a post to play it
- Collections, Inbox, Trash and search
- Posts saved with the Stash Chrome extension sync in while the app is running
- Updates install automatically from now on]]></description>
